<div class="mandarin-hanzi">早上</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">zǎoshang</div>

''Meaning:'' morning; early in the day  
''Part of speech:'' noun; time word

!! In context
早上她喜欢喝茶。 — Zǎoshang tā xǐhuan hē chá. — She likes to drink tea in the morning.

!! Usage note
A time expression, occurring before the subject (早上她…) or between subject and predicate (她早上…). The second syllable is normally neutral.
